.TH ZVM-VMU 1 "August 2026" "ZVM" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zvm-vmu \- configure Zig and ZLS version-map sources
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zvm vmu zig
.I url
.br
.B zvm vmu zig default
.br
.B zvm vmu zig mach
.br
.B zvm vmu zls
.I url
.br
.B zvm vmu zls default
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure the remote metadata sources used to resolve Zig and ZLS releases.
Custom URLs must use HTTP or HTTPS and must expose schemas compatible with the
official sources.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B zig
Set the Zig version-map URL.
The value
.B default
restores the official ziglang.org map;
.B mach
selects the Mach Engine Zig version map.
.TP
.B zls
Set the ZLS release-worker URL.
The value
.B default
restores the official releases.zigtools.org source.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
zvm vmu zig mach
zvm vmu zig https://example.com/zig/index.json
zvm vmu zls https://example.com/zls/
zvm vmu zig default
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zvm (1),
.BR zvm-install (1),
.BR zvm-list-remote (1),
.BR zvm-mirrorlist (1)
